with this policy's treatment of other electronically-delivered products above.\n<h2>Customer delays</h2>\nDelivery timelines do not begin until payment and the required intake information are complete. A refund is not available for delays caused by missing, incomplete, or inaccurate customer information.\n<h2>Duplicate or incorrect charges</h2>\nIf you believe you were charged more than once or that a payment was processed incorrectly, use the form below and include the order date and order number.\n<h2>How to request help</h2>\nSubmit the form below with your order details. Requests are reviewed against the terms that applied when the purchase was made.\n<div class=\"contact-box\">\n<h2>Send a message</h2>\nUse this form for questions, accessibility assistance, privacy requests, or order support.\n\n[contact-form to=\"hello@scrollyseo.com\" subject=\"New website message\"]\n[contact-field label=\"Name\" type=\"name\" required=\"1\" /]\n[contact-field label=\"Email\" type=\"email\" required=\"1\" /]\n[contact-field label=\"Subject\" type=\"text\" required=\"1\" /]\n[contact-field label=\"Message\" type=\"textarea\" required=\"1\" /]\n[contact-field label=\"Send message\" type=\"submit\" /]\n[/contact-form]\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n&nbsp;",
