 the order is completed — consistent with this policy&#8217;s treatment of other electronically-delivered products above.</p>\n<h2>Customer delays</h2>\n<p>Delivery timelines do not begin until payment and the required intake information are complete. A refund is not available for delays caused by missing, incomplete, or inaccurate customer information.</p>\n<h2>Duplicate or incorrect charges</h2>\n<p>If you believe you were charged more than once or that a payment was processed incorrectly, use the form below and include the order date and order number.</p>\n<h2>How to request help</h2>\n<p>Submit the form below with your order details. Requests are reviewed against the terms that applied when the purchase was made.</p>\n<div class=\"contact-box\">\n<h2>Send a message</h2>\n<p>Use this form for questions, accessibility assistance, privacy requests, or order support.</p>\n<div data-test='contact-form'\n\t\t\tid='contact-form-66-1'\n\t\t\tclass='jetpack-contact-form-container '\n\t\t\tdata-wp-interactive='jetpack/form' data-wp-context='{\"formId\":\"66-1\",\"formHash\":\"34345d4c9b9a752391fd2d39932959663bfe190b\",\"showErrors\":false,\"errors\":[],\"fields\":[],\"isMultiStep\":false,\"useAjax\":true,\"submissionData\":null,\"formattedSubmissionData\":[],\"submissionSuccess\":false,\"submissionError\":null,\"elementId\":\"jp-form-34345d4c9b9a752391fd2d39932959663bfe190b\",\"isSingleInputForm\":false,\"isForcedHorizontal\":false}'\n\t\t\tdata-wp-on--focusin=\"actions.trackFirstInteraction\"\n\t\t\tdata-wp-watch--scroll-to-wrapper=\"callbacks.scrollToWrapper\"\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"contact-form-submission contact-form-ajax-submission\" data-wp-bind--aria-hidden=\"state.isSuccessMessageAriaHidden\" data-wp-class--submission-success=\"context.submissionSuccess\" id=\"contact-form-success-34345d4c9b9a752391fd2d39932959663bfe190b\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-form-success-header-34345d4c9b9a752391fd2d39932959663bfe190b\"><p class=\"go-back-message\"><a class=\"